# Hand-made links from guide notebook cells to the code they demonstrate. This file is the source: edit it directly.
# Each link names a cell by notebook and cell id, the dotted identifiers it demonstrates (as in
# functionality.ttl), and a hash of the cell's source from when a person last reviewed the link.
# `python scripts/check_notebook_links.py` compares the hashes with the notebooks and fails on a changed,
# moved or broken cell; review those with the review-notebook-links skill, then `--restamp`.

@prefix nl: <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/ns/codekg/curated/notebook-links#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix slkg: <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/ns/codekg#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

